<title>UK: Electrolux sets 1.0 bln Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Electrolux sets 1.0 bln Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ELECTROLUX</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    15.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.39    PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.94     SPREAD	+52 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA2	LISTING    PAR/LUX   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR/SE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.45	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OCTOBER 2004 OAT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
